    "body": "Copies 32 specification files byte-for-byte from six accepted maintenance candidates (#299, #298, #297, #305, #303, #306). Records eight exact source mappings and 72 future product acceptance labels, preserving original authors and the primary assembler. README is inherited unchanged.\n\nEntry: docs/reviews/five-hour-2026-11-11/eight-spec-mapping/HANDOFF.md. The portable integrity check passes 33 source files, eight targets and 72 labels. Formal owner registration, independent eight-section mapping review, apply and readiness are separate next steps. Wallpaper/ping continue existing builds and savings upgrades an existing tool; these three are excluded from new ready stock. No product code, homepage, browser acceptance or deployment changes.",
